{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうも〜こんにちは生駒ちゃんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てかコメント！\n数凄いです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな数初めてで、今だに携帯がバクってるんじゃないかと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、それだけ見て下さっているのだとおもったら、凄くありがたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"安心して活動出来ます！(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/04/25/6000641/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"携帯変えてから、なんか文字打つのが楽しくてしょうがないです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/04/25/6000641/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな私はお稽古が難しくて、パンクしそうでありんす。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にょーお稽古一日中やりたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぎゃあああああ追いつかない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも頑張らなきゃっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ！"}],"source":"archive"}